-- (instantiated from the twin block of No allotment of shares to transferor company or its nominee (merger) (s 914); see work/expand.py)
§§ `No allotment of shares to transferor company or its nominee (division) (s 930)`

-- JURAL the members of the transferor companies: immunity from dilution by allotments to a company holding its own shares | the scheme: disability to provide for them
-- src:12941 | The scheme must not provide for any shares in a transferee company to be allotted to—
-- src:12942 | (a) the transferor company (or its nominee) in respect of shares in the transferor company held by the transferor company itself (or its nominee); or
-- src:12943 | (b) a transferee company (or its nominee) in respect of shares in the transferor company held by the transferee company (or its nominee).
