    IF `the document is made available on a website which is maintained by or on behalf of the transferee company and identifies the company`
       AND (NOT (`access to the document on the website is conditional on the payment of a fee or otherwise restricted`))
       AND `s 906A(6) the document was available throughout the period beginning one month before, and ending on, the date` `first day on which the document was continuously available on the website` `last day on which the document was continuously available on the website` `date of the first meeting of members, or any class of members, of the transferor company summoned for the purpose of agreeing to the scheme`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "This subsection is satisfied for a document if— (a) the document is made available on a website which is maintained by or on behalf of the transferee company and identifies the company, (b) access to the document on the website is not conditional on the payment of a fee or otherwise restricted, and (c) the document remains available on the website throughout the period"

-- The documents are those listed in the applicable paragraphs of section 926(3)(a) to (f): one answer per document (the caller supplies the answer of (4A) or (4B) for each).
-- src:12980 | (3) The second condition is that subsection (3A) or (3B) is satisfied for each of the documents listed in the applicable paragraphs of section 926(3) relating to the transferee company and every other company involved in the division.
@ref s 932(3) The second condition: subsection (3A) or (4B) is satisfied for each of the documents listed in section 926(3)(a) to (f) (src:12980)
