@ref s 932(5) The first, second and third conditions are subject to section 934 (src:12993)
GIVEN `s 934(1)(b) section 932 has effect without its first, second and third conditions` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 932(5) the first, second and third conditions are subject to section 934` MEANS
    CONSIDER `s 934(1)(b) section 932 has effect without its first, second and third conditions`
    WHEN JUST TRUE THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN JUST FALSE THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the court has not so directed, and s 932(5) says nothing else
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): whether the court has so directed is not known

