-- The court's power: in the case of a division the court may by order direct (a) that sections 921 and 926 do not apply to a company involved, and (b) that section 932 has effect
-- without its first, second and third conditions for an existing transferee company, if the court is satisfied that the conditions will be fulfilled in relation to that company.
-- JURAL the company: power to ask for the direction | the court: power to direct; the members and creditors: liability to the direction
-- src:13021 | (1) In the case of a division, the court may by order direct that—
-- src:13022 | (a) in relation to any company involved in the division, the requirements of—
